{"name":"-57-4-2","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_wind_grass","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Park_a","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Truth","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Late at night, in the quiet Forest Park. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The air is stifling with humidity. You sit alone on the wet and cold park bench, looking at the leaves glistening in the street lights. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Unlike the white sunlight reflected during the day, the light now is hazy and misty, like teardrops welled up in the corner of the eye."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Book","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"With a morose sigh, you unfold the hellish training regimen you have written out earlier and start scribbling down all the training notes for today."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Creep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The training plan was unreasonably demanding to begin with, but the Franchouchou members still insisted on raising the difficulty. As a result, the training was extremely ineffective on the first day. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Sakura had lost her voice; Ai and Junko were off their game; Tae and Lily were both suffering from joint issues; Yugiri wasn't doing very well either, but she did her best holding everything together."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_File_Put","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As you recall the difficult afternoon, the training plan slips out of your hand and flutters to the ground. You let out another sigh. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"None of the battle plans you've made at Griffin have ever been such a terrible failure. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And this isn't even the worst."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Maybe my talents are only suited to being a commander? Am I really just completely hopeless as an idol manager? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If only I could get in touch with the base. At least I would be able to consult the Dolls who had experience as idols..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Ninja","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Some people may look close but are in fact far, far away. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Others may look far, but are actually right before you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ninja?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","value":"%%type_id=2%%duration=2%%delay=0.1%%range=6","raw":"controll_shake"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A wispy voice speaks through the rustling leaves."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No matter which world you're in, you just don't cherish those right before you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You mean... I should just talk directly with Franchouchou and discuss our thoughts? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You have a point. I just can't help thinking about Griffin..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What I mean is—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You should give me a call and ask for my professional opinion."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"m_wv_title","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Once again, you feel the urge to just stand up and leave, but the ninja stops you by putting his hand on your knees."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is this your training plan?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, it's not working well at all."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Book","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The ninja picks up the piece of paper from the ground. His eyes turn from a calm lake into an erupting volcano."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"%%type_id=2%%duration=3%%delay=0.1%%range=8","raw":"controll_shake"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Thunder_Dry","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What the hell is this?!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...An emergency training plan for Franchouchou."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Training?! What training?! Are you trying to make these zombies die a second time?!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uh... They're zombies. Surely they can handle dying again?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey!!! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No human would be able to improve as an idol by following this outrageous plan!!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_File_Put","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"}],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They're not robots, you know?!!!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see. No wonder I've been having so much trouble with this job. I have only ever commanded Dolls..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Enough with the nonsense. What's this stuff you've been writing on the side?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, a brief summary of Franchouchou's performance today."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The volcano in the ninja's eyes are no longer erupting. The ninja's eyes are now two flat voids and are as dull as volcanic ashes drifting through the air."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is a total disaster! The worst I've ever seen in my entire life!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"}],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's even more disastrous than only having 500 people show up at a performance meant for 30,000!!!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I have more bad news for you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You shift your gaze guiltily."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The concert organizer just gave me a call to tell me that the venue for the performance in three days has been given to another idol group under Kalina Entertainment—"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A group called Gray Tree. Have you heard of them? I hear they're even better than Late Night Café..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ninja?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_XXS_kick","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The ninja has collapsed to the ground. There's no answer no matter how you try to wake him."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Meetingroom","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Door_Open_Close","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...An hour later, you drag the Franchouchou girls away from the karaoke box and dance studio by force and take them back to the mansion."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sakura","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-270","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sakura Minamoto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, what are we doing here all of a sudden?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MizunoAi","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"60,-190","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ai Mizuno","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't we usually eat in the sitting room?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Tae","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-290","spriteScale":"1.3"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Bite","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Tae Yamada","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Awoo... awoo... (She seems to be chewing on some unknown object.)"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I have something important to say to you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Standing by the blackboard, you meet the girls' eyes solemnly one by one. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is where you met Franchouchou when you first woke up. You believe this gives the place some special significance."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lily","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"70,-160","spriteScale":"1.24"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lily Hoshikawa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're not... going to leave us, are you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've made you a promise. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But regardless of that, I'll still stick with you till the end."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Yugiri","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"120,-150","spriteScale":"1.9"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Yugiri","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Saki","expression":11,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-150","spriteScale":"1.34"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Saki Nikaido","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sheesh, what's with all this cheesiness?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Junko","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"60,-90","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Junko Konno","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So what is it, Commander?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You take a deep breath. You've been mulling over what you are about to say long and hard. Every single word matters."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Saga_AVG_Dusk","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sakura","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-270","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sakura Minamoto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh?! Commander... why are you apologizing?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I was too heedless when I put together this training plan. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I didn't consider how an idol should grow; I only cared about forcing improvement in the most efficient way. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I never consulted any of you when coming up with this plan; I just went ahead on my own. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I saw how much this plan had cost you today, and I am deeply sorry."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MizunoAi","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"60,-190","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ai Mizuno","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, it wasn't entirely your fault. It was mine too... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I was too anxious and impatient and I let that get to me. I kept pressing you to push us harder..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Junko","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"60,-90","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Junko Konno","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The same goes for all of us. We started panicking because of how far behind we were and threw ourselves into our training recklessly."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Yugiri","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"120,-150","spriteScale":"1.9"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Yugiri","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Everything that happened today wasn't the fault of any one person. We all had a part in it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lily","expression":11,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"70,-160","spriteScale":"1.24"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lily Hoshikawa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's right, we're a collective!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Franchouchou girls all stand up and gather around you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sakura","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-270","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sakura Minamoto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, you don't have to apologize to us..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Saki","expression":11,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-150","spriteScale":"1.34"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Saki Nikaido","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"These things don't have to be said out loud to be understood."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I think it is necessary for me to tell you how I feel, because it only occurred to me today that I had never shared my inner thoughts with you before. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We should've communicated better so we'd be on the same page..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Creep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You pause as the girls stack their hands on top of yours."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Also, we're about to face our grimmest challenge."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sakura","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-270","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sakura Minamoto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If you're referring to the venue canceling on us... we're already aware of that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MizunoAi","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"60,-190","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ai Mizuno","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're trying to find a new venue."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Junko","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"60,-90","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Junko Konno","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But because it's at such short notice, we may only be able to get something small."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Saki","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-150","spriteScale":"1.34"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Saki Nikaido","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Still, this concert is 100% happening! No matter where we do it, Franchouchou is Franchouchou!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You smile at these girls who are determined to stay strong and are doing their best to comfort you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Someone once told me that an idol should perform on a stage that befits them. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Franchouchou's concert in three days can only take place here—"}]}]},{"sprites":